        <name>MD 2026: Zhuhai, 淇澳岛</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v6HwUPdeKBURka0XOFuP1U4bVymjNOhVzjqxtrU9tTPhcYAhP1DEDmlfo4rZu_Z7UZx2hS2W2-60mD78RMbZiGVT1uZKWV549t9fi5aKcvdD98xuKkhy7KSmjx3QxtQDGaqGs1KC66_SDoo3gxxDEv02CHHMS2ptzfLSE9_gqqSPVcEJGf8EH76MM0vZKFrCP7EZT3tQZ41JjedvK_WtJWVPszAxBE-7OLCyLPrBqUPtwWmy9nwqlVB8uJpqjLtJQ9pf4bsmI9DjR81V9P3zgZVA7sHKNTmtBgYZrHdb2gxRc--iua_NvNwdFSZyyRyGzqd1sFk0nvn-Q2dCvCV9VOKdoCNNHVXspbVNzOoAWNSAd8PNKq2a0Z76OQ89VlMV4CZS6f99pW6ZXDsbuzJ9LPnxvEX2Ef3KhKNX86xB5PWgdP7dH8Vp6heBMu1WlIqI5WOBccoeJJAZqhfB29A8bbV64HALhADl7b2rBG4Bczd3v-NQiB8ndBjzsLE9AABaQjXJduIoPP6NhVzK3QPk7PqWZq2GFys3a65CGhkL-g-ic4v4583Bx-AdFvUjWPOFQ7sIcx3R1lAHJaJtR1AX7Cr6AefDsMj7paUmsXLzGq6C5HEJac0UXezm2tvvgd5MGwI6amDm00X3kkXHqTlEmlfRV8YoZ5m4qRqeZbRMTkQaR3gwN_UDZh3T0WpyMx7d5sfMHVvVJJkp3COVKvioVSarD23Dw" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>说明: <br><br>淇澳岛位于珠海市东北部，通过淇澳大桥与市区相连，是一座兼具深厚历史底蕴与迷人海岛风光的生态之岛。岛上拥有大片茂密的红树林湿地保护区，白鹭飞掠，生机盎然。漫步在古朴的白石街上，两旁的青砖老屋诉说着当年岛上居民奋勇抵抗外敌的英雄历史。这里远离城市喧嚣，将自然生态与人文历史完美交融，是探寻珠海古村落文化与享受慢活时光的绝佳去处。<br><br>type: marker<br>id: 896b1290-a6dc-4c9f-9433-0d5c1a3c2e68<br>original_color: #a24ac3<br>type: marker<br>id: 896b1290-a6dc-4c9f-9433-0d5c1a3c2e68<br>original_color: #a24ac3]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-FF5252</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="说明">
            <value>

