        <name>MD 2026: Zhuhai, 圆明新园</name>
        <description><![CDATA[<img src="https://lh3.googleusercontent.com/umsh/AN6v0v7K5RKn1pJ5n6s6fpVIBHI5EAmiWrptzCV3IwTXz5cz8MIQVVE4ZvZBRVgxSVVoOquM9JWE-5QzEgmDGBmTCu23NjfwMTuX2uZqikvYSGh6zrSMtSzmXnQRuNp482oD_gaoBuGaum4NfIYvS7A7hEfgca861OpN7l3KSe-n_hyzH8vZ61sl0H52wgpjnpz9dF9GxrIoN8RmZV4g7SkAk3sWHVRrLkFpkVNdECGzat5l61K42lzfnagiOLURfvNVEMum9VqtH10Y4H-qDgpC0oZuCgCyGqHnh8roHO-0PfGC4FRtXhnrIwTBHuK-bvfw9qx9vWK0GuTqRJJNhb4MtE4iiHd1gttsyboTGObRL984-Uz3oBzuuAu-9LTQSQ6do95zBx6TNx9TJCmxVNp1eyPwCRYAHOkr3A5FPdBXISd92KlHe9_CY6osgd3snReGW_XHgzpsZbCbCTPmGmWgdvnHikTZwm8qNx8Cbrth0ohMrjvFmxv76WSxW_o9URFfg3zVJ-NQJ5sjQnk4vqgV2P4RctwMzBFQBwQpSZFGyjhEeuFkHPXSfkQfqA6L2oGp3wkkltctCQiu7_0SpSPMmHyBgFPYzKxoTNy67RT9IyilhRLPbyilIdhuqjMIRllPhjbYd1dx5OojjV7nJ0f1gt1Y6qP-EElOWMiBcA_7FRuSrQhXy0sFsfjkzyu27NWcs8eWQnWctgxut1FjKaJEgBhEulbVCg" height="200" width="auto" /><br><br>说明: <br><br>圆明新园以北京圆明园被焚毁前的建筑为蓝本，按 1:1 比例精选复建了四十景中的十八景。它将古典皇家建筑群、江南园林景观与西洋建筑风格完美融合。在这里，你可以漫步于红墙金瓦间，沉浸式感受清朝鼎盛时期的辉煌气象与历史余晖。<br><br>type: marker<br>id: 500ea847-9cc3-43d8-b095-4b9411283913<br>original_color: #a24ac3<br>type: marker<br>id: 500ea847-9cc3-43d8-b095-4b9411283913<br>original_color: #a24ac3]]></description>
        <styleUrl>#icon-1899-FF5252</styleUrl>
        <ExtendedData>
          <Data name="说明">
            <value>

圆明新园以北京圆明园被焚毁前的建筑为蓝本，按 1:1 比例精选复建了四十景中的十八景。它将古典皇家建筑群、江南园林景观与西洋建筑风格完美融合。在这里，你可以漫步于红墙金瓦间，沉浸式感受清朝鼎盛时期的辉煌气象与历史余晖。

